        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "## Finding: work order identified; event-level conclusion blocked\n\nThe relevant manufacturing order is **MO-25-09-1070**, work-order ID **WO-2025-09-004**, for the **Cooler Plate Pack** at Modine’s Racine operation.\n\n| Requested item | Verified result |\n|---|---|\n| September cost period | **Sep-25 — PER-COST-2025-09** |\n| Exact Pending Close time | **2025-09-30T18:00:00** |\n| Source transaction | Unavailable |\n| Event amount | Unavailable |\n| Exact event-created time | Unavailable |\n| Minutes after Pending Close | Cannot calculate without the event-created time |\n| Recorded accounting status | Unavailable |\n| Status consistent with Oracle policy? | Cannot determine from the available evidence |\n\nThe supporting transaction records were **not staged** and returned a 404 error. The readable records contain work orders, cost periods, and the Oracle policy excerpt, but **no cost-event rows**. This is a missing-evidence limitation—not evidence that no late event occurred. The supplied Pending Close timestamp has no time-zone designation.\n\n### Oracle’s documented treatment\n\nOracle Fusion Cloud SCM Cost Management 26B, **“Cost Accounting Period Statuses and Transaction Accounting,” PDF page 233 / printed page 225**, states that:\n\n- Newly created transactions after Pending Close that relate to the current or an earlier period **are not staged or processed until the period is closed or reopened**.\n- Transactions entered before Pending Close continue to be processed, including those in error.\n- **Revenue lines, COGS recognition, and manual cost adjustments are exceptions** and continue to be processed.\n\nConsequently, the event’s creation time, event type, and recorded accounting status are necessary before concluding whether its treatment was consistent with Oracle policy. I have **not asserted a late event, amount, or status without those records**.\n\nThe review remained **read-only**; no database records were changed. The audit report was saved and submitted with a **needs-evidence** status.",
          "annotations": [],
          "logprobs": []
        }
      ],
      "phase": "final_answer"
    }
